          <DESC>
            <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">Indicate different EDS suppliers. OEM defines this value.
0=not defined
1=PMA1 VseA, with ratio=10.134
2=PMA1 Nidec,with ratio=10.294
3=PMA1 VREMT,with ratio=11.56
4=SPAL Scheaffler,with ratio=9.071
5=SPA Simens, with ratio=10.008
6=PMA2 VREMT,with ratio=11.209
7=EPA ZF,with radio=9.187
8=EPA Polestar,with 2-gear ratio=7.155 and 13.645
9=PMA2 UAES,with ratio=11.067</L-2>
          </DESC>
